- GET `/admin/editions/{editionId}/sanctions` → pending sanctions grouped by player (player_id, name, team, total_debt, sanctions[{id,type,label,amount,match_label,minute}]), plus totals. Read access: assertCanRead + assertOwnedEdition (admin group already ensures role).
