- DELETE `/admin/editions/{id}/suspensions/{suspensionId}`
Exclusions analogous.
- Prizes: GET `/admin/editions/{id}/prizes` and PUT.

Mobile screens:
- `admin_sanctions_page.dart`: tabs? Could be a "Disciplina" hub with tabs: Sanciones, Suspensiones, Exclusiones. A single page with DefaultTabController and 3 tabs. Each tab has its own list and FAB to add (sanction card, suspension, exclusion) via bottom sheets/forms. This is a lot; maybe separate pages simpler for maintainability: 
